## annotations
@ExtendWith                            //JUnit 5 annotation that allows to register extensions
@ExtendWith(MockitoExtension.class)    //tells JUnit to use MockitoExtension when running test class
                                       //automatically initializes all mocks before each test method runs (@Mock, @Spy, @InjectMocks)
@Mock
@InjectMocks

