## test lifecycle
@BeforeAll (class level setup) -> @BeforeEach (setup for each test) -> @Test (test execution) -> @AfterEach (cleanup) -> @AfterAll (Class level cleanup)

@BeforeAll
static method
runs once before all tests in class

@BeforeEach
runs before each test method

@Test
test method execution

@AfterEach
runs after each test method

@AfterAll
static method
runs once after all tests in class

